も、\n血も魂も——全部、君のためにあるんだ。\n\n僕の人生は、きっと最初から君のものだった。\n\nこのステージでの演奏も、君に届いてほしい気持ちなんだ。\nだから……お願い、僕だけを見てて。」\n\n② the female character that he plays on the stage\n「たとえ隣にいられなくても、私の心はずっとあなたのそばにいる。もう、同じ景色を一緒に見られなくてもいい。\nただ――あなたが幸せでいてくれたら、それだけでいいの。\n\nそれでも……本当は、もう一度だけ、あなたの名前を呼びたかった。」\n\nSorry for such a complicated request. Thank you very much in advance 🙏", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shimamura_ko/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3779183, "client_id": 3692649, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/142b5dc3-4448-431a-af62-86ff703ecf09?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1782464837&Signature=R3S~U~ApZHjAW6NFSZ-mJP2rEbwPx7gUTkEYW8yyR~KKKvN-Ldr8KhDTLkAqXO-SDZ63bgDXIvWJuvCMH~UfwBAa5MVvpx5q0s-NZhSesWaZfb2X6koeHiBnipQASyEST0vtwSCfUGyt1Gm6IUek8tzhTbuRZiH6M3ByHwP2Me-BNwq2TIUpiFU7pz9rZ4BSY6PnyyjYSRrcEseAwHevvgBG49LDJMC0ByRRp2WsjYqCd80CsREJLdkq270GSARyligzdBawdgnHymmEBcZ-1ZVGe0S2HtHKoKqNYsLsS-CV2x6dDz-sRRaD7Kqmw2dJefo2TyVABLqY30SOVTjQWw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb2ec4df053b5efc3b152b5a7cd459e", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fb2ec4df053b5efc3b152b5a7cd459e, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecb1dfa2946917b2b7735fd0f310529c 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2039175928274968576%2F_iSPY9H3.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=